Yeah, sure.

00:28:29.730 --> 00:28:32.510
So I think you would
refer to your--

00:28:32.510 --> 00:28:35.060
someone asked a question
about your tech stack earlier.

00:28:35.060 --> 00:28:36.680
But I kind of
