00:28:36.680 --> 00:28:39.500
a little bit of that last
mile of how you deliver

00:28:39.500 --> 00:28:44.330
your results to the business.

00:28:44.330 --> 00:28:49.070
Yeah, so I'd say
a couple avenues.

00:28:49.070 --> 00:28:51.110
We build and maintain
