00:29:12.830 --> 00:29:15.980
the Microsoft stacks; it's
Excel, it's PowerPoint,

00:29:15.980 --> 00:29:17.630
it's Word.

00:29:17.630 --> 00:29:20.510
And it's been a big
ambition of mine

00:29:20.510 --> 00:29:23.450
to get away from that mindset.

00:29:23.450 --> 00:29:26.330
But it's a real reality.

00:29:26.330 --> 00:29:29.480
And part of it is a
lot of the outputs

00:29:29.480 --> 00:29:34.010
that we generate make their
way into other source documents

00:29:34.010 --> 00:29:37.310
or deliverables that I
